    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1768">

                <pb facs="1290" n="1174" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1174"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 419.11D29/93.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 18, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Minister for Foreign Affairs agrees to proposition as presented in your telegram
                    May 14. I suggest for consideration the question of <pb facs="1291" n="1175"
                        xml:id="pg1175"/> attempting to settle all pending cases’ together except
                    those arising from the last two riots.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
